# Tasks in the pure lane (notes/layers.md, sugar): a task runs at once, where it's started, so `go x` is x's value and
# awaiting it is that value; `await all jobs` the values, `await any`/`first` the first one's. No thread runs beside it.
rewrite await go {$body...} => ($body...)
rewrite await go $x => $x
rewrite go {$body...} => ($body...)
rewrite go $x => $x
rewrite await all $xs => $xs
rewrite await any $xs => $xs#1
rewrite await first $xs => $xs#1
rewrite await $x => $x
